{"id":"inverno","lemma":"inverno","pos":"noun","rank":1473,"glosses":["winter (the coldest of the four seasons)","winter (a period of decay or inactivity)","the rainy season"],"ipa":"/ĩˈvɛʁ.nu/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"invernos"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/d/d3/LL-Q5146_%28por%29-Nelson_Ricardo_2500-inverno.wav","examples":[{"text":"Eu odeio o inverno.","en":"I hate the winter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to loathe","l":"odiar"},{"g":"the / it"},null]},{"text":"Nós tivemos um difícil inverno.","en":"We had a difficult winter.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"to own","l":"ter"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"difficult"},null]},{"text":"Ainda faço isso todo inverno.","en":"I still do that every winter.","words":[{"g":"still"},{"g":"to create","l":"fazer"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"every"},null]},{"text":"Este inverno será muito frio.","en":"This winter will be very cold.","words":[{"g":"this"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"very / a lot"},{"g":"having low temperatures"}]},{"text":"Eu adoro viajar no inverno.","en":"I love traveling in the winter.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to love","l":"adorar"},{"g":"to travel"},{"g":"in the"},null]}]}